{"title":"Chest","sourceTitle":"Chest/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Chest\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Chest (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chest/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Coffre (91% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chest/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Сундук (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chest/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"木箱 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.18.15</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:200px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Baú</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Chest-east.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/100px-Chest-east.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/150px-Chest-east.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/200px-Chest-east.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Material</b>\n</td>\n<td>Quadros\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Gotas</b>\n</td>\n<td>Em si\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Blocks\" title=\"Blocks\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Blocos</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Baús</b> são <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Containers#Stationary_Containers\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Containers\">recipientes estacionários</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Containers#Stationary_Containers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Containers\"> </a></span> que podem ser colocados no chão. Eles podem ser usados ​​para armazenar até 16 itens. Um baú é feito de 2 baús e possui 36 slots. Isso torna os baús mais eficientes do que os 2 baús usados ​​para fazê-los, mas exigem dois blocos vazios.\n</p><p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Baú\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Baú</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Porta-malas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Porta-malas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Furniture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Comerciante de móveis</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Furniture\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> vende baús que custam de 1,5 a 2,5 marchas. Baús de madeira envelhecidos podem ser encontrados em ruínas com uma variedade de itens dentro deles.\n</p><p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Chest\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Ba.C3.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Baú\">Baú</span></h3>\n<p>Um baú é montado a partir de 8 <a href=\"/Boards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boards\">tábuas</a> em uma formação quadrada com 1 em cada fenda e 1 <a href=\"/Nails_and_strips\" title=\"Nails and strips\">pregos e tiras</a> no centro que pode ser de qualquer metal.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r429685\">.mw-parser-output .gridItem{width:50px;height:50px;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output .gridItemNumber{bottom:4px;right:4px;position:absolute;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;font-size:21px;line-height:17px;text-align:right;color:white}</style><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Nails_and_strips\" title=\"Pregos e tiras\"><img alt=\"Pregos e tiras\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Grid_Nails-and-strips.png/50px-Grid_Nails-and-strips.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Grid_Nails-and-strips.png/75px-Grid_Nails-and-strips.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/af/Grid_Nails-and-strips.png/100px-Grid_Nails-and-strips.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:102px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:102px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:102px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Tábua de carvalho\"><img alt=\"Tábua de carvalho\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Chest\" title=\"Baú\"><img alt=\"Baú\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/50px-Chest-east.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/75px-Chest-east.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/100px-Chest-east.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><span id=\"Trunk\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Porta-malas\">Porta-malas</span></h3>\n<p>Um baú é montado a partir de 2 baús seguidos, com 1 em cada slot.\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r429685\" /><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Chest\" title=\"Baú\"><img alt=\"Baú\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/50px-Chest-east.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/75px-Chest-east.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/100px-Chest-east.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Chest\" title=\"Baú\"><img alt=\"Baú\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/50px-Chest-east.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/75px-Chest-east.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d2/Chest-east.png/100px-Chest-east.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Trunk\" title=\"Porta-malas\"><img alt=\"Porta-malas\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_Trunk.png/50px-Grid_Trunk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_Trunk.png/75px-Grid_Trunk.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_Trunk.png/100px-Grid_Trunk.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Os baús originalmente não precisavam de metal nas versões anteriores.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Como as caixas não requerem pregos, elas são um meio mais barato de armazenamento a granel. O jogador precisa de uma serra, entretanto, para criar tábuas para caixotes.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Container\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Container\">Recipiente</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Container\" title=\"Container\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table cla